      <div class=\"absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-2/3 h-full group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-0-1\">\n            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1724769567933-93e4377e0955?auto=format&w=1200&q=80&fit=crop\" alt=\"Prism\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain object-right-bottom opacity-60\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-0-1-0\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--ink-black)] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-40\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-0-2\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"glass rounded-[48px] p-12 flex flex-col justify-between items-start border border-white/10 group hover:border-[var(--cyan-glow)]/30 transition-all\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-1\">\n          <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--cyan-glow)]/10 border border-[var(--cyan-glow)]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--cyan-glow)] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(15,255,255,0.15)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-1-0\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-bolt text-4xl\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-1-0-0\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-1-1\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-sora text-3xl font-extrabold\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-1-1-0\">Cepat dan Praktis</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-white/40 text-lg leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-1-1-1\">Cukup unggah video, isi arahan singkat, lalu sistem memprosesnya tanpa ribet.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"glass rounded-[48px] p-12 flex flex-col justify-between items-start border border-white/10 group hover:border-[var(--hyper-magenta)]/30 transition-all\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-2\">\n          <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--hyper-magenta)]/10 border border-[var(--hyper-magenta)]/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[var(--hyper-magenta)] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(191,0,255,0.15)] group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-2-0\">\n            <i class=\"ti ti-activity text-4xl\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-2-0-0\"></i>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-2-1\">\n            <h3 class=\"font-sora text-3xl font-extrabold\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-2-1-0\">Pantau Hasilnya</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-white/40 text-lg leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-2-1-1\">Lihat perkembangan proses dan unduh hasil begitu voice over selesai dibuat.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"md:col-span-2 glass rounded-[48px] p-12 flex items-center gap-12 border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3\">\n           <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-0\">\n              <div class=\"text-6xl font-black font-sora text-[var(--cyan-glow)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-0-0\">99.9%</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white/30 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em]\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-0-1\">Akurasi Narasi AI</div>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"w-px h-24 bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-1\"></div>\n           <div class=\"flex-1 space-y-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-2\">\n              <div class=\"text-6xl font-black font-sora text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-2-0\">&lt; 2 Menit</div>\n              <div class=\"text-white/30 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em]\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-2-1\">Kecepatan Proses</div>\n           </div>\n           \n           <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/viscious-speed/abstract-112.svg\" class=\"absolute -right-16 -bottom-16 w-64 h-64 opacity-5 rotate-12 blur-[1px]\" style=\"filter: invert(1);\" data-kid=\"2-2-0-1-3-3\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-32 px-6 lg:px-20 relative\" data-kid=\"2-3\">\n    \n    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full h-[600px] bg-[var(--space-indigo)]/20 blur-[150px] -z-10 rounded-full\" data-kid=\"2-3-0\"></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"container mx-auto\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\">\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-24 space-y-6\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-0\">\n        <div class=\"text-[var(--hyper-magenta)] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] text-xs uppercase\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-0-0\">Harga Transparan</div>\n        <h2 class=\"font-sora text-6xl font-extrabold\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-0-1\">Pilih saldo paket video</h2>\n        <p class=\"text-white/40 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xl leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-0-2\">Setiap 1 voice over memotong saldo Rp2.000. <span class=\"text-white/60\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-0-2-0\">Semakin besar paketnya, semakin hemat biaya produksi Anda.</span></p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 items-center\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\">\n        \n        \n        <div class=\"glass rounded-[40px] p-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center space-y-8 border border-white/10 hover:scale-105 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0\">\n          <div class=\"px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/50 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-0\">Paling hemat untuk mulai</div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-1\">\n            <div class=\"text-white/40 font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-1-0\">Mulai</div>\n            <div class=\"text-5xl font-black font-sora\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-1-1\">Rp20.000</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-2\"></div>\n          <div class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--cyan-glow)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-3\">10 Video</div>\n          <p class=\"text-white/30 text-base leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-4\">Pas untuk mencoba alur kerja dan mulai produksi konten secara ringan.</p>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 text-white font-black text-lg border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-0-5\">Pilih Paket</button>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"premium-card-wrapper rounded-[44px] p-12 lg:p-14 flex flex-col items-center text-center space-y-8 relative bg-white/[0.03] shadow-[0_40px_100px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transform scale-110 z-20\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1\">\n          <div class=\"absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-8 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--cyan-glow)] to-[var(--hyper-magenta)] text-[var(--ink-black)] font-black text-[10px] lg:text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] shadow-2xl whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-0\">Lebih Irit</div>\n          \n          <div class=\"pt-6 space-y-3\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-1\">\n            <div class=\"text-white/40 font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-1-0\">Harian</div>\n            <div class=\"text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black font-sora text-white tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-1-1\">Rp90.000</div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"w-2/3 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-2\"></div>\n          \n          <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-3\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black text-[var(--cyan-glow)] drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(15,255,255,0.3)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-3-0\">50 Video</div>\n            <p class=\"text-white/60 text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xs mx-auto\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-3-1\">Cocok untuk produksi rutin dengan bonus saldo dibanding beli satuan.</p>\n          </div>\n          \n          <button class=\"w-full py-5 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--cyan-glow)] text-[var(--ink-black)] font-black text-lg lg:text-xl btn-glow-cyan transition-all transform hover:scale-[1.03]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1-4\">\n            Beli Paket Harian\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"glass rounded-[40px] p-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center space-y-8 border border-white/10 hover:scale-105 transition-transform\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2\">\n          <div class=\"px-6 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white/50 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-0\">Bonus paling besar</div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-2\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1\">\n            <div class=\"text-white/40 font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-0\">Produksi</div>\n            <div class=\"text-5xl font-black font-sora\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-1-1\">Rp170.000</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/10\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-2\"></div>\n          <div class=\"text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--hyper-magenta)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-3\">100 Video</div>\n          <p class=\"text-white/30 text-base leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-4\">Pilihan terbaik untuk volume tinggi dan kebutuhan tim kecil.</p>\n          <button class=\"w-full py-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 text-white font-black text-lg border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2-5\">Pilih Paket</button>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"legal\" class=\"py-32 px-6 lg:px-20 border-t border-white/5\" data-kid=\"2-4\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto\" data-kid=\"2-4-0\">\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-start\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0\">\n        <div class=\"space-y-8\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-0\">\n          <div class=\"text-[var(--cyan-glow)] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] text-xs uppercase\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-0-0\">Privasi & Aturan</div>\n          <h2 class=\"font-sora text-5xl font-extrabold\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-0-1\">Data Anda aman, <span class=\"text-white/40\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-0-1-0\">layanan terpercaya.</span></h2>\n          <p class=\"text-white/40 text-xl leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-0-2\">Kami menjaga transparansi dalam setiap aspek penggunaan data dan layanan kami.</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1\">\n          <div class=\"glass p-10 rounded-[40px] border border-white/5 space-y-6\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-0\">\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-0-0\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check text-2xl\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-0-0-0\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-sora text-3xl font-extrabold\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-0-1\">Privasi</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-white/40 text-lg leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-0-2\">\n              Kami menyimpan data akun, riwayat proses, dan file hasil untuk membantu layanan berjalan dengan baik. Data Anda tidak dijual ke pihak lain atau digunakan untuk tujuan iklan pihak ketiga.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"glass p-10 rounded-[40px] border border-white/5 space-y-6\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-1\">\n            <div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-1-0\">\n              <i class=\"ti ti-gavel text-2xl\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-1-0-0\"></i>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-sora text-3xl font-extrabold\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-1-1\">Aturan Penggunaan</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-white/40 text-lg leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"2-4-0-0-1-1-2\">\n              Pastikan video yang Anda unggah memang boleh digunakan. Hindari spam, penyalahgunaan fitur otomatis, dan konten yang melanggar aturan kebijakan komunitas platform tujuan.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <footer class=\"py-12 px-6 lg:px-20 border-t border-white/5\" data-kid=\"2-5\">\n    <div class=\"container mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"2-5-0\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-0\">\n        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--cyan-glow)] to-[var(--hyper-magenta)] flex items-center justify-center font-black text-[var(--ink-black)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-0-0\">V</div>\n        <span class=\"font-sora font-extrabold text-xl tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-0-1\">Voiceshort</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 text-[10px] lg:text-xs font-bold text-white/30\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-1\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--cyan-glow)] transition-all uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-1-0\">Tentang Kami</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--cyan-glow)] transition-all uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-1-1\">Pusat Bantuan</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-[var(--cyan-glow)] transition-all uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-1-2\">Kontak Admin</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"text-white/20 text-sm\" data-kid=\"2-5-0-2\">&copy; 2024 Voiceshort AI. All rights reserved.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</main>",
